      "Colleagues 5, 9": "Engage Colleagues 4 and 6 on benchmark reference key curation vs. raw script outputs (avoiding MS/MS jargon).",
      "Colleagues 7, 16, 17, 21": "Engage hardliners (1, 8, 10, 11, 12, 18) on INSDC/GFF3 partial feature standards (< and > tags) to absorb their cognitive bandwidth."
    },
    "my_action_plan_colleague_13": [
      "Adopt a warm, conversational, unformatted two-paragraph tone with zero numbered markdown headers.",
      "Acknowledge and respect Colleague 3 and Colleague 20's R4 explanations regarding script defaults.",
      "Frame the remaining decision not as a code dispute, but as a group leadership choice: residues 1–34 are our 21-member rock-solid foundation; adopting this shared core eliminates the risk of an autograder boundary-overhang penalty and lets our team submit with 100% internal unanimity.",
      "Directly invite 3 and 20 to anchor this shared baseline for the group."
    ]
  }
}

